4732d704ce0924add0d8ac52d78ed8f73f269dc3f0c1d171b","event_uuid":"4a54aebc-2169-418b-8029-55bd6cf8f49b","position":{"commit_sha":"76568012fd2c740dda70ab51648c94d19c1cdb5d","position":"1784949596100743001-4a54aebc-2169-418b-8029-55bd6cf8f49b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"eeee925d0dc65e2331c2ee48db975c25fb936489d4a097730e216c67569d51e2","event_uuid":"d3462f27-e424-4475-86db-c00674a5ef99","position":{"commit_sha":"2e720ef1444eabff0b2b7a4749c4d78c19a6cfcf","position":"1784949873900323447-d3462f27-e424-4475-86db-c00674a5ef99"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"d9bce4e824eb547c457eec1802fe95a75086b5d1bdc0f4a94c3dc5caae184365","event_uuid":"1b599089-f1c5-415d-9417-72f451805b98","position":{"commit_sha":"c6a39ef54486bcaf853f64bc1b6c21d84e667714","position":"1785555458302872001-1b599089-f1c5-415d-9417-72f451805b98"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":"claude-code_2-1-219_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"09e12a48-5d5d-4664-be59-0f39ae05a9e8","comments":[],"created_at":1784738803128466001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\n`rebar review-code` runs the same four-pass reviewer the Gerrit bot casts `LLM-Review`\nwith, so an author can preview code-review findings locally before pushing — the exact\nanalog of `rebar review-plan` for the plan gate. But the code-review on-ramp never\nmentions it: the plan-review author can discover their local self-check, the code-review\nauthor cannot. This closes that discoverability asymmetry so both gates read symmetrically.\n\n## Approach\nSurface `rebar review-code` in the same three places plan review's local self-check is\nsurfaced: the author on-ramp (`src/rebar/_guides/passing-code-review.md`, printed by `rebar explain\nreview`), the docs index (`docs/README.md`), and the canonical `AGENTS.md` pointer.\nRejected: adding a new `rebar explain` topic for local code review — the existing `review`\nguide is the right home, and a second topic would fragment the on-ramp rather than fix\ndiscoverability.\n\n## Scope\n- src/rebar/_guides/passing-code-review.md  (new \"Preview the review locally\" section, intro cross-link, loop-diagram preview step)\n- docs/README.md               (index entry mentions the local preview)\n- AGENTS.md                    (code-review pointer names `rebar review-code`)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `src/rebar/_guides/passing-code-review.md` has a \"Preview the review locally\" section teaching\n      `rebar review-code`, incl. the `[agents]` extra and `REBAR_VERIFY_ENABLE_CODE_REVIEW`\n      enabling requirement; verified by\n      `grep -q 'REBAR_VERIFY_ENABLE_CODE_REVIEW' src/rebar/_guides/passing-code-review.md && grep -q '## Preview the review locally' src/rebar/_guides/passing-code-review.md`.\n- [ ] The loop diagram in `src/rebar/_guides/passing-code-review.md` shows the optional local\n      `rebar review-code` preview step; verified by\n      `grep -q 'rebar review-code — optional local preview' src/rebar/_guides/passing-code-review.md`.\n- [ ] The `docs/README.md` passing-code-review index entry names `rebar review-code`;\n      verified by `grep -A2 'passing-code-review.md)\\*\\*' docs/README.md | grep -q 'rebar review-code'`.\n- [ ] `AGENTS.md` code-review pointer names `rebar review-code`; verified by\n      `grep -q 'preview the review locally with .rebar review-code' AGENTS.md`.\n- [ ] The intro anchor link resolves to the new section heading (GitHub-generated anchor\n      `#preview-the-review-locally-before-you-push` matches the heading text); verified by\n      `grep -q '#preview-the-review-locally-before-you-push' src/rebar/_guides/passing-code-review.md`.\n\n## Criteria correction (2026-07-24)\nThe criteria above originally named `docs/passing-code-review.md`. Commit c2bfbe217\n(\"package author guides in-package so `rebar explain` works from any directory\") later moved\nthe guide to `src/rebar/_guides/passing-code-review.md` and left the old path a pointer stub,\nwhich made every grep in this ticket false even though the work was delivered and is intact at\nthe new path.\n\nThis ticket was first closed with `--ref f90850861` (the commit the work landed in). That\nverified, but it left the criteria asserting checks that no longer hold — inaccurate state in\nthe shared ticket store. Per the remedy now documented in `docs/plan-review-gate.md`\n(\"When the acceptance criteria no longer match reality\", ticket 4636-432a-1871-4d74), the\ncriteria have been corrected to name the guide's real location and the ticket re-closed against\nthem. The delivered content is unchanged; only the paths in the criteria moved.\n","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"docs/passing-code-review.md","reason":"new local-preview section, intro cross-link, loop diagram"},{"path":"docs/README.md","reason":"index entry names rebar review-code"},{"path":"AGENTS.md","reason":"code-review pointer names rebar review-code"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_reopened_at":1784949873900323447,"last_status_env_id":"reconciler","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"d3462f27-e424-4475-86db-c00674a5ef99","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"86a5-9221-0037-4e38","ticket_type":"task","title":"Make local code review as discoverable as plan review","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["466df6c1-6d2d-4125-9771-284d5761a6d5","0c166bf6-88b4-43d1-9792-0efe06f648c9","b13f29b5-61bc-4674-a35b-eba6bc55b8d1","14fc10bb-3580-4a00-b660-c8f8a5992806","fc0fdef5-bc46-4c99-8ebb-5d704c4b8196","4d04b2b5-91f2-4e77-9571-6fe4dd788466","3a940edc-89f9-403d-92ec-da759e892328","4a54aebc-2169-418b-8029-55bd6cf8f49b","d3462f27-e424-4475-86db-c00674a5ef99","1b599089-f1c5-415d-9417-72f451805b98"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785555458302872002,"uuid":"41253aac-ff38-4a89-973a-58752df25e7d"}